                                                "sense_id": "d8cb21ec-d18e-3631-953c-f12ce776d90d",
                                                "text": "to toy with a piece of food on one’s plate"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d7bc8ca-4281-4de3-a7a0-25a2dfdfc7d7",
                                                "sense_id": "d8cb21ec-d18e-3631-953c-f12ce776d90d",
                                                "text": "Figo is toying with the English defence."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "22136c5f-3020-40a4-927d-a07591b4b669",
                                                "sense_id": "d8cb21ec-d18e-3631-953c-f12ce776d90d",
                                                "text": "His [Hercules's] Lyons skin chaungd to a pall of gold, / In which forgetting warres, he onely ioyed / In combats of ſweet loue, and with his miſtreſſe toyed."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
